WEBVTT

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:15.590
atarashii yakusoku ga kokoro wo tsuyoku tsunagu

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:15.590
Our new promise binds our hearts together strongly

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:22.680
kawaru sekai ni kane ga hibiku yukou

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:22.680
The bell rings in the changing world, let's go

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:29.520
owari naki tatakai ga subete wo hiki saitemo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:29.520
Even if the endless fight shreds everything apart,

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:35.700
kimi no hohoemi tada shinjite

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:35.700
I will believe in your smile

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.910
kimi no yume mamoreru nara

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.910
If I can protect your dream,

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.500
itami sae dakishimeyou

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.500
I will even embrace pain

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:52.800
kasane au kono omoi mune no chikai yuzurenai

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:52.800
I can't let go of these piling feelings, this oath in my heart

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:59.550
aa, sora no haruka hate made

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:59.550
Ah, all the way to the end of the sky,

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:07.770
sou, kakete yuku you na kasoku shiteku jounetsu

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:04.350
yes, my passion accelerates

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.770
as if it were rushing through my body

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:13.940
aa, donna unmei datte

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:13.940
Ah, no matter what kind of fate awaits me,

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:25.080
sou, takaku koeteku makenai yuuki kureta kara

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.240
yes, I can fly high over it

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:25.080
because you gave me this undefeatable courage

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.060
Third Wing

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.060
The Wind's Response

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:39.200
Well? Who are <i>you</i>?

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.170
I'm just someone who got lured in by the scent of sake.

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.150
Cut the crap!

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.360
Don't tell me that you're also his Sekirei or some-

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:47.820
She's not!

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.970
Th-That person really has nothing to do with me!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.500
So don't touch her!

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.500
Crap...

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.710
Man, he won't shut up.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.280
Haihane, hurt him a little.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:09.680
Oh... I forgot to ask for the recording at Kougashitsu.

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:11.600
Did I ever tell you

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.260
Now!

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.890
Kazehana-san, get away!

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.430
I can't find him...

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.250
Where in the world are you, Minato?

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:27.620
Musubi!

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.340
Tsukiumi-san! Are you done with your errands?

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.850
That's not an issue right now!

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.910
Minato was kidnapped by the Disciplinary Squad!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.890
Kid... nap?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.890
TL Note: Sarawareta (kidnapped) vs. sara wareta (broken plate)

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:44.160
I found him!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.570
Yay!

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.960
Imperial Capital Pier, fifth depot!

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:49.060
Matsu!

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:49.820
Matsu-san!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:51.940
Perfect timing!

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.710
No. 104?!

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.890
Those two together...

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.140
This could be pretty hard to deal with.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.050
So Minato-san is in that depot at the pier, right?

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.340
Yes, there's no doubt about that.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:06.500
Tsukiumi-san.

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:07.420
Yes.

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:10.400
Barging in all of a sudden is dangerous! What about a plan?

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:12.570
We don't have time for that! Let's go.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:13.500
All right!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.250
At least take a cell with you!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.160
We had such a rough time with the Disciplinary Squad while trying to escape, too.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.590
Onii-chan...

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.520
Those two will be fine.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:33.750
Miya-tan?

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.370
Besides...

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:47.800
Reeks of alcohol...

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.740
Hey, you! What are you doing?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.490
No, the sake... I'm getting... dizzy...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.020
Are you stupid or something?!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.140
He- He's going to run away!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.670
Hurry up and ca-

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.720
K-Kazehana-san...

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.290
D-Damn you!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.340
Flower Party!

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.660
You two...

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.340
The Disciplinary Squad-

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.300
Are you trying to make a fool of us?!

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:33.160
The Disciplinary Squad, I'm telling you the Disciplinary Squad is...

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.030
This one's useless...

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:43.200
Now then...

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.440
Isn't it about time to get serious?

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.360
I was just thinking the same thing.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.140
You're slow, Musubi!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.260
Right!

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.830
Tsukiumi-san's a world faster than during our shopping challenge.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:04.520
It's amazing!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.200
Just wait, Minato...

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:09.850
I'll definitely...!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.550
Heh, you're pretty good.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:34.720
Don't you act like it's a piece of cake, grandma.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:38.070
Oh, does it look that way, Flatty?

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:39.440
Flat?

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:48.950
Flatty...

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.980
You! You looked, right?

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:56.940
Eh?!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.030
You looked, didn't you?!

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.870
More like "came into my view" than "looked"...

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:06.150
To think that I was seen by someone other than Natsuo...

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:08.070
Kill...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.180
I'll kill you no matter what!

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.550
Oh, shoot. Isn't this a little bad?

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.960
Did you think you could beat us two against one?

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:32.190
Haihane.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.920
What the hell are you doing?!

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:37.770
I'm sleepy...

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.060
God, you're useless!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:41.680
N-Now...

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:46.370
Quickly!

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:48.090
Y-Yeah...

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.230
Like I'd let you go!

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.130
Great Quake!

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:57.880
Watch out!

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:07.550
Ashikabi-kun!

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:12.190
You could've just obediently called out No. 88.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.480
Hold on! Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.300
This has nothing to do with Sekirei or Ashikabi...

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:24.990
I don't want anyone to get hurt because of me, no matter what.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.820
No matter what!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.430
No more... I don't want to go through that...!

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.580
Oww!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:34.860
This is this kid's...

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.030
How pure...

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.500
Give up already!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:46.500
Annihi-

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:52.460
What?!

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.810
Yup. It's not logical.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:59.140
Kazehana-san?

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.070
I won't ask if you want me.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:06.240
I'm the one that wants you.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.500
Eh? Wai

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:12.130
You'll worry about me.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.650
Cry for me. And love me.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:21.010
That's the kind of person we need.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.460
The wind blowing from you was a little unreliable,

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.200
but... kind.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:34.790
Good morning.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.020
Good morning at this time of day?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:38.990
I can't sleep that well recently.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.830
It's kind of quiet, but... where's everyone?

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.130
The wind yielded.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:47.870
Hm? What?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.830
It seems like you've finally become the last.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:52.100
The last?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:53.900
Does that mean...?

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:56.400
All right, I have to get dinner ready.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:57.470
Hey Miya!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.030
What's with this?

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.160
It's hot...

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:17.530
Something hot is swarming around my body.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.720
It's gently melting away my feelings for that person with heat, too.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:24.370
Thank you.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:27.750
I think I can finally let go of my former love.

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.000
She became winged.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:37.670
Huh?!

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:46.890
Wind of my contract,

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.530
blow away the dark clouds above the Ashikabi!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:52.870
Flower Whirlwind!

00:09:57.130 --> 00:09:57.740
Over there!

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.170
What's that?!

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:00.890
No idea.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:06.000
I feel like this happened before...

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.670
Dammit! I'll remember this!

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.970
A-Amazing...

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.150
Sekirei No. 03, Kazehana.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.420
I'll accept you as my Ashikabi.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:23.810
My new love!

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.980
New carp?

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:26.980
TL Note: Koi means love/carp...

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:31.630
Forever and ever, my Ashikabi-kun.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:37.530
Eh?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.690
Y-You two!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:42.630
You fool! Just what are you doing?!

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:45.860
Did you become winged as well, Kazehana-san?

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.030
Ts-Tsukiumi, Musubi-chan...

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:57.320
Minato!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:59.330
What's the meaning of this?!

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:00.930
E-Err...

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.630
Minato-san, you're awesome! This is your fifth!

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:05.210
Musubi, shut up!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.980
You! What happened to the story of lost love you told me?!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:13.630
But I explained it to you. Falling in love isn't logical.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.640
Will you stop already?!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.350
Oh, I thought I told you before...

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:25.440
that the only people allowed to talk to me that way are No. 01 and the Game Master.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.340
Don't.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.960
Get along, everyone. Okay?

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:32.700
Ashikabi-kun!

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:33.660
Minato!

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:33.660
Minato-san!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.370
Well, well, wasn't that an interesting show.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:46.740
But...

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.820
It's disappointing that <i>she</i> didn't make it.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:53.030
It really is.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.270
It still won't connect.

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.200
Maybe something happened?

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.900
Gosh, stupid Nii-chan.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:06.780
Hm?

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:09.600
Hello?

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:11.200
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.890
Eh? Oh, okay, got it.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.370
Yeah. Bye.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:17.830
What happened?

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.990
Onii-chan's got a sudden errand to run and can't come.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.610
So that's what it was.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.040
But... I wonder why Mother called?

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:29.170
Well then...

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:37.390
Kazehana.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:44.520
It's okay, I won't do any harm. Tell that to Miya.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.740
There's not enough...

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.350
of anything and everything.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.130
Individual No. 88 was captured by the enemy.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.810
Retrieve it at all costs!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.650
The bird that teaches love.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.480
That is apparently the wagtail's second name.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.650
They say that people who love and are loved grow stronger in return.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:34.370
Sekirei are the same.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:39.950
Little birds that will someday spread their wings and teach love to the world.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:45.870
Then, since I have diverted from that path, I will at least protect these little birds.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:49.720
That's what being the Sekirei of Fate is about.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:51.690
Right?

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:56.910
Love... Please, teach these little birds of love.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:01.100
That is your...

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.570
Musubi-chan...?

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.010
Thank goodness, you came to.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:07.930
Minato!

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:10.180
Huh? Did I-

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:13.790
Minato, are you all right? Does it hurt anywhere?

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.740
No... Is this a hospital?

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.610
It's the Imperial City Hospital, run directly by M.B.I.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:24.620
I was told that here they would attend to you for free, Ashikabi-sama.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:27.510
Told? By who?

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.140
There was no damage to the brain.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.380
A temporary lapse of consciousness due to an impact to the head.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.190
Well, you can be discharged in two or three days.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:40.260
M-Mom?!

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:43.100
Mom?!

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.630
Hey, did you get a little thinner? Are you eating properly?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.210
Eh? Well, yeah...

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:51.940
Oh, right. I was going to meet Yukari and-

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:56.240
I told her that you won't make it because of a sudden errand. Since I heard about it from Musubi.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.780
Thank goodness... Wait.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:01.800
Why? Why are you here, Mom?

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.230
C-C-Could it be that Takami is...

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.500
Minato-san's mother?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:09.090
You know my mom?

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:14.330
Where should I begin...

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:18.640
I told you that I work for a pharmaceutical company, right?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.010
Y-Yeah.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.470
Sorry. That was a lie.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:23.400
A lie?!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.290
I'm M.B.I.'s Sekirei Project Head Officer, Sahashi Takami.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.360
Due to certain circumstances, I have taken the liberty of temporarily securing Sahashi Minato.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.350
M.B.I...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.420
Musubi got adjusted by Takami-san.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.570
A-Adjusted?!

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.810
I'll go change the water.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.450
Wai- Musubi-chan!

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:53.210
Minato, there are a few things I'd like to ask you about.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:00.010
Karasuba-sama!

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.920
I suddenly felt like seeing your face, Muu-chan.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.270
It's pretty impressive that you knew I was here.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.980
A lot of information flows in when you work at the main office.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.720
Oh, that's how Takami-san also...

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.030
So you didn't fight Benitsubasa, eh?

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.890
I sort of didn't make it.

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:21.820
Seems like it.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:26.330
You almost deleted them, didn't you?

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:27.890
Karasuba-sama.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:33.040
Then there's no doubt Musubi crashed...

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.290
Musubi-chan didn't seem to remember it,

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:42.010
but the Sekirei symbol disappeared once, and then her body began to shine.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.180
No. 08, The Sekirei of Fate.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:49.110
I, Yume, will be your opponent!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.970
No. 08?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:53.170
The restart after her crash...

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.610
The numbers 08 that showed up on her stomach...

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.480
The scene back then was full of unknowns.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:02.030
Who is this No. 08, Takami?

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:06.190
It seems like the time to explain this has finally come.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:14.900
You should be calling me Mother, shouldn't you? Tsukiumi?

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:19.420
M-Mom, what are you saying...?

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:25.000
How foolish of me! This was my once in a lifetime mistake!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.610
M-M-Mother!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:30.430
Well, that was a joke.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.980
Tsu-Tsukiumi, calm down!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.430
There are a lot of aspects of it that we don't know about, either.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.990
Musubi herself has a complicated history.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:46.110
Musubi-chan has a complicated history?

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.540
A level 4 Sekirei? Got it.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:55.990
Sorry, I have to work. See you, Minato.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.120
Wai- Mom!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:17:59.600
The recovery team better be out already.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:01.620
Level 4?

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.760
One who has incurred enough damage to crash.

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.600
There are 5 levels.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.940
Level 4... That's a pretty bad injury.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:19.350
Karasuba-sama... I smell blood.

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:29.400
Muu-chan, I need you to become even stronger.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:35.320
Just like that person. No, even stronger than that person.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.890
And then that promise...

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.280
We'll become the last two...

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.320
And then with the world at stake...

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.860
Until then, have fun killing.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.300
Karasuba-sama...

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.140
I'm home.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:02.160
Onii-chan!

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.200
I'm back, Kuu-chan.

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.650
We'll celebrate your return today, Sahashi-san.

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.980
Oh, don't exaggerate.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.250
Really, we're relieved that it wasn't anything that bad.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:21.570
Kuu was really, really worried!

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:23.700
Sorry, Kuu-chan.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.550
But... I was the foolish one this time.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:29.770
My Ashikabi was injured because of me.

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:31.920
I'm sorry, Minato.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:33.920
Tsukiumi...

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:41.840
What's up?

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:45.560
Oh, you're back. That sure was quite unfortunate.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:48.340
Uzume-san, I'm sorry I worried you.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.680
So you made another Sekirei?

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:53.550
Made? Uzume-san!

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:55.620
You really <i>are</i> amazing.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.380
Man...

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:05.370
Now that you mention it, I don't see Kazehana-san around...

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.660
Ah, Kazehana-san is...

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:13.080
Welcome back, Minato-kun!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:16.670
K-Kazehana-san!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:18.860
Oh, this is the legendary...!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:20.970
W-What's with that outfit?!

00:20:22.510 --> 00:20:29.600
Using "san" towards your new wife? It's Kazehana. Just...call...me

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.110
The naked apron outfit is forbidden in the Izumo Inn.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.140
Why Miya... What a scary face...

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.440
Number 19, by the Black Sekirei?

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:47.650
I see. Also Kazehana... No. 03, we can't get her anymore.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:53.670
You don't want Hannya of the North to make a move either, do you?

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.850
That's why you made me do the hunting in the northern area.

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.310
I understand. I get it already.

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.460
In return... About Chiho...

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.730
Uzume-chan!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:06.990
All right. I'm hanging up.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.080
Miya says that this is no good.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.210
Can I see your collection again, Uzume-chan?

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.790
Sure, take whatever you want.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.080
You sure have a lot.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:26.150
Ah, I wonder which one I should wear to make Minato-kun happy.

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:27.680
The Sekirei sign...

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.550
If I touch this and recite the ritual prayer...

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:38.410
It seems like you've finally become the last.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:46.180
I won't become anyone's possession. Nor do I plan on ever doing so.

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:53.270
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:53.270
All kinds of fate depend on you

