tsuyoi kimochi wo kakaete

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:14.340
strong feelings

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.400
His fifth Sekirei?

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:21.460
Is Minato trying to create an inner palace?

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:23.650
So then, you'd be the manager.

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:30.940
Fool! Do you think I'd say, "You can't even make tea correctly. Oh man, this is why I don't like young people" or something?

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:31.810
Are you an office lady or something?!

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:34.110
Fourth Wing: The Last One.

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:35.850
Tune in next week, and forever and ever.
